---
import AppLayout from '../layouts/AppLayout.astro';
---

<AppLayout title="Green Consulting for C&I Wind & Hybrid | OnLoop Energy" description="OnLoop Energy's green consulting services help Commercial & Industrial businesses determine whether small wind or hybrid energy systems make genuine economic and technical sense for their site — before any capital is committed.">
<div>
            





            {/* Hero Section */}
            <section class="hero hero--short">
                <div class="container">
                    <div class="hero__content">
                        <div class="hero__badge" style="margin-top: var(--space-12);">
                            <span class="hero__badge-dot"></span>
                            Green Consulting
                        </div>
                        <h1 class="hero__title">Advice That Starts With <span class="hero__title-highlight">Engineering</span>
                        </h1>
                        <p class="hero__subtitle">We help you decide what actually makes sense for your site , before any
                            technology, equipment, or investment decisions are made.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </section>

            {/* Introduction */}
            <section class="content-section fade-in">
                <div class="container">
                    <div class="grid-2">
                        <div>
                            <span class="content-section__label">Our Approach</span>
                            <h2 class="content-section__title">Decisions First. Installations Later.</h2>
                            <p class="content-section__text">
                                Renewable energy decisions are often made too quickly , before fully understanding how a site
                                behaves, how energy is consumed, or what constraints actually matter.
                            </p>
                            <p class="content-section__text">
                                At OnLoop Energy, consulting exists for one reason: clarity. We study your C&I site conditions, load
                                profile, infrastructure, and long-term objectives before recommending any wind or hybrid
                                solution. We do not consult on BESS, residential, or government projects.
                            </p>
                            <p class="content-section__text">
                                Sometimes the right answer is to proceed. Sometimes it’s to pause, redesign, or not build at
                                all. Our responsibility is to tell you the truth , clearly, calmly, and with technical reasoning
                                behind every recommendation.
                            </p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="image-card image-card--large">
                            <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1454165804606-c3d57bc86b40?w=800&h=500&fit=crop"
                                alt="Renewable energy engineering consultation and site feasibility study" />
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </section>

            {/* Consulting Services */}
            <section class="content-section content-section--light fade-in">
                <div class="container">
                    <div class="content-section__header" style="text-align: center; max-width: 100%;">
                        <span class="content-section__label">What We Offer</span>
                        <h2 class="content-section__title">Green Consulting Services</h2>
                    </div>
                    <div class="grid-3">
                        <div class="card">
                            <div class="card__icon">
                                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"
                                    stroke-width="1.5">
                                    <path d="M21 10c0 7-9 13-9 13s-9-6-9-13a9 9 0 0 1 18 0z" />
                                    <circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3" />
                                </svg>
                            </div>
                            <h4 class="card__title">Site Feasibility Studies</h4>
                            <p class="card__text">
                                A ground-level understanding of your site , including solar exposure, wind
                                behavior, terrain, access, grid availability, and structural constraints , evaluated as they
                                actually exist, not as assumptions.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="card">
                            <div class="card__icon">
                                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"
                                    stroke-width="1.5">
                                    <polyline points="22 12 18 12 15 21 9 3 6 12 2 12" />
                                </svg>
                            </div>
                            <h4 class="card__title">Load Profile Analysis</h4>
                            <p class="card__text">
                                Detailed analysis of how and when energy is consumed, helping align generation
                                strategies with real demand rather than theoretical averages.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="card">
                            <div class="card__icon">
                                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"
                                    stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                                    <path d="M12.22 2h-.44a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v.18a2 2 0 0 1-1 1.73l-.43.25a2 2 0 0 1-2 0l-.15-.08a2 2 0 0 0-2.73.73l-.22.38a2 2 0 0 0 .73 2.73l.15.1a2 2 0 0 1 1 1.72v.51a2 2 0 0 1-1 1.74l-.15.09a2 2 0 0 0-.73 2.73l.22.38a2 2 0 0 0 2.73.73l.15-.08a2 2 0 0 1 2 0l.43.25a2 2 0 0 1 1 1.73V20a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h.44a2 2 0 0 0 2-2v-.18a2 2 0 0 1 1-1.73l.43-.25a2 2 0 0 1 2 0l.15.08a2 2 0 0 0 2.73-.73l.22-.39a2 2 0 0 0-.73-2.73l-.15-.08a2 2 0 0 1-1-1.74v-.5a2 2 0 0 1 1-1.74l.15-.09a2 2 0 0 0 .73-2.73l-.22-.38a2 2 0 0 0-2.73-.73l-.15.08a2 2 0 0 1-2 0l-.43-.25a2 2 0 0 1-1-1.73V4a2 2 0 0 0-2-2z" />
                                    <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3" />
                                </svg>
                            </div>
                            <h4 class="card__title">Technology Selection</h4>
                            <p class="card__text">
                                Objective evaluation of solar, wind, and hybrid configurations based on site
                                data and performance logic , not product availability or vendor alignment.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="card">
                            <div class="card__icon">
                                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"
                                    stroke-width="1.5">
                                    <line x1="12" y1="1" x2="12" y2="23" />
                                    <path d="M17 5H9.5a3.5 3.5 0 0 0 0 7h5a3.5 3.5 0 0 1 0 7H6" />
                                </svg>
                            </div>
                            <h4 class="card__title">Financial Modeling</h4>
                            <p class="card__text">
                                Practical financial projections built around realistic generation, losses,
                                operating costs, and policy conditions , designed to support informed decisions, not optimistic
                                spreadsheets.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="card">
                            <div class="card__icon">
                                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"
                                    stroke-width="1.5">
                                    <path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z" />
                                </svg>
                            </div>
                            <h4 class="card__title">Regulatory & Grid Advisory</h4>
                            <p class="card__text">
                                Clear guidance on policies, grid connectivity pathways, approvals, and
                                compliance requirements , translated into actionable next steps.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="card">
                            <div class="card__icon">
                                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"
                                    stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                                    <path d="M5 21c.5 -4.5 2.5 -8 7 -10" />
                                    <path d="M9 18c6.218 0 10.5 -3.282 10.5 -9c0 -2.5 -1.25 -5 -3.5 -6c-3.165 0 -6 1.835 -8 5c-2 3.165 -3 6.5 -3 10c0 .5 0 1 1 1" />
                                    <path d="M14 6c0 2 -.5 4 -2 5" />
                                </svg>
                            </div>
                            <h4 class="card__title">ESG & Decarbonisation Pathways</h4>
                            <p class="card__text">
                                Strategic roadmap development for corporate Environmental Sustainability Goals (ESG). We map out viable decarbonisation paths integrating verifiable carbon credits and measurable milestones.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </section>

            {/* How We Work */}
            <section class="content-section fade-in">
                <div class="container">
                    <div class="content-section__header">
                        <span class="content-section__label">Process</span>
                        <h2 class="content-section__title">How We Work</h2>
                    </div>
                    <div class="grid-2">
                        <ul class="feature-list">
                            <li class="feature-item">
                                <div class="feature-item__icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                                    fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                                    <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10" />
                                    <path d="M8 14s1.5 2 4 2 4-2 4-2" />
                                    <line x1="9" y1="9" x2="9.01" y2="9" />
                                    <line x1="15" y1="9" x2="15.01" y2="9" />
                                </svg></div>
                                <span class="feature-item__text"><strong>Discovery:</strong> We start by understanding your
                                    objectives, constraints, and decision timeline , not by assuming a solution.</span>
                            </li>
                            <li class="feature-item">
                                <div class="feature-item__icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                                    fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                                    <path d="M21 10c0 7-9 13-9 13s-9-6-9-13a9 9 0 0 1 18 0z" />
                                    <circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3" />
                                </svg></div>
                                <span class="feature-item__text"><strong>Site Visit:</strong> On-site assessment to observe real
                                    conditions: solar access, wind exposure, electrical infrastructure, space limitations, and
                                    operational realities.</span>
                            </li>
                            <li class="feature-item">
                                <div class="feature-item__icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                                    fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                                    <polyline points="22 12 18 12 15 21 9 3 6 12 2 12" />
                                </svg></div>
                                <span class="feature-item__text"><strong>Analysis:</strong> Engineering-led evaluation of site
                                    data, load behavior, and technology pathways using established, conservative
                                    methodologies.</span>
                            </li>
                        </ul>
                        <ul class="feature-list">
                            <li class="feature-item">
                                <div class="feature-item__icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                                    fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                                    <path d="M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z" />
                                    <polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8" />
                                </svg></div>
                                <span class="feature-item__text"><strong>Report:</strong> A clear, documented assessment
                                    outlining findings, trade-offs, and recommendations , written to support decision-making,
                                    not selling.</span>
                            </li>
                            <li class="feature-item">
                                <div class="feature-item__icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                                    fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                                    <path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2" />
                                    <circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4" />
                                    <path d="M23 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87" />
                                    <path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75" />
                                </svg></div>
                                <span class="feature-item__text"><strong>Review Meeting:</strong> A structured walkthrough of
                                    results with your team, addressing questions, risks, and alternative approaches.</span>
                            </li>
                            <li class="feature-item">
                                <div class="feature-item__icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                                    fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                                    <path d="M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14" />
                                    <polyline points="22 4 12 14.01 9 11.01" />
                                </svg></div>
                                <span class="feature-item__text"><strong>Ongoing Support:</strong> Advisory support during
                                    vendor selection, EPC discussions, or design review , if and when you need it.</span>
                            </li>
                        </ul>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </section>

            {/* Why Independent Consulting */}
            <section class="content-section content-section--light fade-in">
                <div class="container">
                    <div class="grid-2">
                        <div>
                            <span class="content-section__label">Why It Matters</span>
                            <h2 class="content-section__title">Good Energy Decisions Are Rarely Obvious</h2>

                            <p class="content-section__text">
                                Renewable energy systems rarely fail because of technology. They fail because early assumptions
                                were never properly tested.
                            </p>

                            <p class="content-section__text">
                                Sizing errors, unrealistic production models, ignored constraints, and misaligned technology
                                choices compound over time. By the time performance issues appear, the design decisions that
                                caused them are already locked in.
                            </p>

                            <p class="content-section__text" style="font-weight: 500; color: var(--color-text-primary);">
                                When decisions are rushed or based on incomplete analysis, the result is often:
                            </p>



                            <p class="content-section__text" style="margin-top: var(--space-6);">
                                Independent consulting exists to slow decisions just enough to get them right , before capital
                                is committed and flexibility disappears.
                            </p>

                        </div>
                        <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: var(--space-8);">
                            <div class="card">
                                <h4 class="card__title" style="font-size: var(--font-size-2xl);">Our Commitment</h4>
                                <p class="card__text" style="font-size: var(--font-size-lg); line-height: 1.9;">
                                    “We will always give you clear, technically honest advice. If a project doesn’t make sense
                                    for your site, we’ll say so , and explain why. Good outcomes begin with good decisions.”
                                </p>
                            </div>

                            <ul class="feature-list">
                                <li class="feature-item">
                                    <div class="feature-item__icon">
                                        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"
                                            stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                                            <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10" />
                                            <line x1="15" y1="9" x2="9" y2="15" />
                                            <line x1="9" y1="9" x2="15" y2="15" />
                                        </svg>
                                    </div>
                                    <span class="feature-item__text">Systems sized around assumptions instead of measured
                                        demand</span>
                                </li>

                                <li class="feature-item">
                                    <div class="feature-item__icon">
                                        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"
                                            stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                                            <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10" />
                                            <line x1="15" y1="9" x2="9" y2="15" />
                                            <line x1="9" y1="9" x2="15" y2="15" />
                                        </svg>
                                    </div>
                                    <span class="feature-item__text">Production estimates that ignore site-specific losses and
                                        variability</span>
                                </li>

                                <li class="feature-item">
                                    <div class="feature-item__icon">
                                        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"
                                            stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                                            <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10" />
                                            <line x1="15" y1="9" x2="9" y2="15" />
                                            <line x1="9" y1="9" x2="15" y2="15" />
                                        </svg>
                                    </div>
                                    <span class="feature-item__text">Technology selections that do not match real operating
                                        behavior</span>
                                </li>

                                <li class="feature-item">
                                    <div class="feature-item__icon">
                                        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"
                                            stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
                                            <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10" />
                                            <line x1="15" y1="9" x2="9" y2="15" />
                                            <line x1="9" y1="9" x2="15" y2="15" />
                                        </svg>
                                    </div>
                                    <span class="feature-item__text">Overlooked grid, regulatory, or operational
                                        constraints</span>
                                </li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </section>

            {/* Who We Work With */}
            <section class="content-section fade-in">
                <div class="container">
                    <div class="content-section__header" style="text-align: center; max-width: 100%;">
                        <span class="content-section__label">Who We Work With</span>
                        <h2 class="content-section__title">Who We Work With</h2>
                    </div>
                    <div class="grid-3">
                        <div class="card">
                            <div class="card__icon">
                                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"
                                    stroke-width="1.5">
                                    <rect x="2" y="7" width="20" height="15" rx="2" ry="2" />
                                    <polyline points="17 2 12 7 7 2" />
                                </svg>
                            </div>
                            <h4 class="card__title">Commercial & Industrial</h4>
                            <p class="card__text">
                                Facilities seeking to reduce grid dependence and stabilize energy costs
                                through captive generation and demand-side engineering.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="card">
                            <div class="card__icon">
                                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"
                                    stroke-width="1.5">
                                    <rect x="2" y="7" width="20" height="15" rx="2" ry="2" />
                                    <polyline points="17 2 12 7 7 2" />
                                </svg>
                            </div>
                            <h4 class="card__title">Process Manufacturers & Heavy Industry</h4>
                            <p class="card__text">
                                Factories, processing plants, and heavy industry operations evaluating whether their site's wind resource and operational load profile support a small wind or hybrid investment.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="card">
                            <div class="card__icon">
                                <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"
                                    stroke-width="1.5">
                                    <rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="2" ry="2" />
                                    <path d="M3 9h18" />
                                    <path d="M9 21V9" />
                                </svg>
                            </div>
                            <h4 class="card__title">Industrial Parks & Large Commercial Estates</h4>
                            <p class="card__text">
                                Multi-tenant industrial parks, warehousing complexes, and large commercial estates with sufficient land and consistent energy loads to justify a wind or hybrid feasibility study.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </section>

            {/* CTA Section */}
            <section class="cta-section fade-in">
                <div class="container">
                    <div class="cta-section__content">
                        <h2 class="cta-section__title">Start With Clarity</h2>
                        <p class="cta-section__text">If you’re evaluating renewable energy options and want decisions grounded
                            in engineering , not pressure , let’s talk.</p>
                        <a href="/contact" class="btn btn--primary btn--large">Request a Consultation</a>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </section>



        </div>

</AppLayout>
